      "interpretation_declared_up_front": "The brief's 0.763 is the INITIALIZATION median. A single edit from a parent already at QED 0.41 cannot reach 0.763, so a literal 'median proposal QED == 0.763' is not attainable by any proposal law at this call site. The testable form is the one measured here: the CHANGE in QED from parent to proposed endpoint. Absolute medians are reported alongside so the raw comparison remains visible."
    },
    "P2_per_edit_gate": {
      "claim": "Mean per-edit dQED under B moves materially toward 0 relative to A, and the percentage of edits LOSING QED falls below A's rate.",
